pan style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"un_number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UN3481\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"proper_shipping_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Lithium ion batteries contained in equipment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"class\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"packing_group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"packing_instruction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PI967\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"section\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"II\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"net_quantity_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"declaration_form\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shippers_declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"signer_training_valid_until\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-03-31\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"port_constraint\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"entry_port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SZX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dg_capable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"handled_classes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"restricted_transfer_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"is_waste\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"pic_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段结构里有三个设计要点。第一，<code>dangerous_goods</code> 是一个<strong>独立的嵌套块</strong>而不是散落在备注里，这样报关行、承运商和海关都能以同样的方式解析。第二，<code>signer_training_valid_until</code> 把签署人培训有效期带进报文，让&quot;签署人培训过期&quot;这类退回原因可以在生成环节就查出来。第三，<code>restricted_transfer_check</code> 显式记录越境转移判定结果——即使结论是&quot;不需要 PIC&quot;，也要留下判定痕迹，因为事后无法区分&quot;判定过且不需要&quot;与&quot;根本没判定&quot;。</p>\n<p><code>packages</code> 与 <code>net_quantity_kg</code> 是必须与实物一致的字段，它们同时也是 <a href=\"../restricted-channel-packing/accept-reject-rule\">收寄拒收规则与查验</a> 的核验项——同一份数据在报关与收寄两处使用，因此应当有单一来源，避免两处不一致导致的申报错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>危险品报关比普货多三项要求：附加单证、口岸限制、属性接入报关主数据。</li>\n<li>空运用托运人声明、海运用多式联运危险货物申报单；两者都是托运人签署的法律声明，签署环节不可完全自动化。</li>\n<li>空运强调受理检查，海运强调积载与隔离；退回高发项都是字段间一致性约束，可在生成环节自动校验。</li>\n<li>危险品通常只能在具备资质的口岸入境，口岸可行性必须与运费时效一样参与过滤。</li>\n<li>废电池与失效电池可能落入越境转移管制，需事先知情同意；这类货物应路由到人工合规流程而非自动放行。</li>\n<li>报关数据中危险品应是独立嵌套块，并显式记录签署人培训有效期与越境转移判定结果。</li>\n<li>件数与净重应与收寄核验共用单一数据来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特货/危险品清关附加要求","id":"特货-危险品清关附加要求"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"运输单证：两种主声明","id":"运输单证-两种主声明"},{"level":3,"text":"空运与海运的受理差别","id":"空运与海运的受理差别"},{"level":3,"text":"托运人声明的常见退回原因","id":"托运人声明的常见退回原因"},{"level":2,"text":"口岸与关境限制","id":"口岸与关境限制"},{"level":2,"text":"特殊管制：废电池与越境转移","id":"特殊管制-废电池与越境转移"},{"level":2,"text":"报关数据的落地","id":"报关数据的落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生鲜时效与保质期 SLA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/special-goods-crossborder-logistics/cold-chain-temp-control/perishable-shelf-sla"},"next":{"title":"大件/重货运输处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/special-goods-crossborder-logistics/special-customs-ops/oversized-heavy-ship"}}